<title>USA: Triathlon looks to maximize value.</title>
<headline>Triathlon looks to maximize value.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Triathlon Broadcasting Co said it engaged its regular financial consultants &quot;to assist it in developing a plan to maximize shareholder value.&quot;</p>
<p>It said the options it may consider include strategic alliances, additional acquisitions, as well as the sale of the company.</p>
